---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Gestión Legal de Empresas | M-GEO Abogados">
  
  <section class="relative bg-brand-dark text-white pt-36 pb-24 px-6 overflow-hidden z-10 border-b border-white/5">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/stardust.png')] pointer-events-none"></div>
    
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/3 w-[50rem] h-[50rem] bg-brand-primary/25 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>

    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-full max-w-6xl h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/15 to-transparent z-10"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl relative z-20">
      
      <a href="/estudio#especialidades" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-400 hover:text-brand-primary font-body text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] transition-all duration-300 mb-12 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5L3 12m0 0l7.5-7.5M3 12h18" /></svg>
        Volver a Especialidades
      </a>

      <!-- <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-5 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary"></span>
        <span class="text-gray-300 font-body text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-bold block">División Corporativa</span>
      </div> -->

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-heading font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
            Gestión legal de <br/>
            <span class="text-brand-primary italic">Empresas.</span>
          </h1>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:pt-4">
          <div class="border-l border-brand-primary/40 pl-6 space-y-4">
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-light text-white leading-relaxed font-heading italic">
              "Ofrecemos la mejor estrategia legal en todas las áreas del derecho para proteger el núcleo de tu negocio."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-[#F9F8F6] px-6 relative z-20">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-12 pt-4">
          
          <div class="space-y-4 border-l-2 border-brand-primary pl-6">
            <span class="text-brand-primary font-body font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[10px] block">Asesoramiento Permanente</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-dark tracking-tight leading-snug">
              Abonos mensuales a medida.
            </h2>
          </div>
          
          <div class="text-gray-600 font-light text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed pl-1">
            <p>
              Representamos legalmente empresas de múltiples sectores y/o rubros que confían en nuestra gestión extrajudicial y judicial de conflictos.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-brand-primary text-white p-8 md:p-10 rounded-sm shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-40 h-40 bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-[30px] pointer-events-none"></div>
            
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl md:text-2xl tracking-tight">Análisis Sin Cargo</h3>
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-6 h-6 text-white/80"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z" /></svg>
            </div>

            <p class="text-white/90 font-light text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Realizamos un diagnóstico inicial de la situación legal de tu empresa sin costo, para trazar el mejor plan de acción.
            </p>

            <a href="https://wa.me/541100000000" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-white font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px] mt-6 border-b border-white/40 hover:border-white pb-1 transition-all">
              Solicitar diagnóstico ahora <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25L21 12m0 0l-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-brand-dark flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xs shrink-0 shadow-md">
              MG
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark uppercase tracking-wider font-body">M-GEO Abogados</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 font-light">Seguridad jurídica permanente para tu operatoria.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:sticky lg:top-32">
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-dark via-[#161616] to-brand-dark text-white border border-brand-primary/20 shadow-2xl p-8 md:p-12 rounded-sm relative overflow-hidden group">
            
            <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-60 h-60 bg-brand-primary/20 rounded-full blur-[80px] pointer-events-none z-0"></div>

            <div class="relative z-10 mb-8 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
              <div class="inline-block bg-brand-primary text-white font-body font-bold text-[9px] px-2.5 py-1 uppercase tracking-widest rounded-sm mb-3">
                Planes a Medida
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Abonos para todos los rubros</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs md:text-sm font-light mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                Contamos con clientes abonados de múltiples sectores que confían la seguridad jurídica de su operatoria en nosotros:
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2">
              
              {[
                'Construcción', 'Salud', 
                'Metalúrgica', 'Textil', 
                'Logística', 'Plástico', 
                'Gastronómico', 'Servicios', 
                'Sistemas', 'Petróleo', 
                'Mensajería', 'Turismo'
              ].map((rubro) => (
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors p-3 rounded-sm border border-white/5 text-gray-200 text-xs md:text-sm font-light">
                  <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-primary shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
                  <span>{rubro}</span>
                </div>
              ))}

            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10 mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col items-center">
              <a href="https://wa.me/541100000000" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full bg-brand-primary text-white py-4 font-body font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[11px] hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-dark transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl text-center block">
                Coordinar Asesoramiento
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>